senses.gloss:
√1ci (cinóti, cinuté; cikyé [787]; ácet;
ceṣyáti, -te; citá; cétum; citvā́; -cítya;
cīyáte).
 —1. arrange in order; pile up;
build; construct, esp. the sacrificial altar;
active, if the priest builds for others; middle,
if the sacrificer builds for himself;
 —2.
gather together, collect; get possession
of.
+ ud, heap up, collect.
+ sam, gather together, collect; accumulate.
